00:53:05.370 --> 00:53:08.490
20% of the cost of the design stage.

00:53:08.970 --> 00:53:12.410
So, the town doesn't pay any money until actual construction.

00:53:12.975 --> 00:53:15.775
So I'd already signed one bridge up for that.

00:53:19.455 --> 00:53:24.575
